WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:03.083
New on AshPhys: share your solution

00:00:03.133 --> 00:00:08.083
Solve a practice question in your own workspace

00:00:08.133 --> 00:00:13.083
Share it under the name you choose

00:00:13.133 --> 00:00:18.617
Your teacher reviews it and approves it

00:00:18.667 --> 00:00:24.217
Other students see it next to the teacher's solution, with your name

00:00:24.267 --> 00:00:26.867
You can withdraw it at any time
